msgstr ""
"Jedinstveni id svakog shortcode-a. Kada imate mnogo shortcode-ova ovog "
"dodatka na istoj stranici, morate koristiti različit id za svaki."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:815
msgid "Single Button Operation"
msgstr "Rad sa jednim dugmetom"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:827
msgid ""
"When it is activated, no Upload button will be shown, but upload will start "
"automatically as soon as files are selected."
msgstr ""
"Kada je aktivirano, nijedno dugme za otpremanje neće biti prikazano, već će "
"otpremanje početi automatski čim se datoteke izaberu."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:830
msgid "Upload Path"
msgstr "Putanja otpremanja"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:842
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This is the folder where the files will be uploaded. The path is relative to "
"wp-contents folder of your Wordpress website. The path can be dynamic by "
"including variables such as %%username%% or %%blogid%%. Please check "
"Documentation on how to use variables inside uploadpath."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je fascikla u koju će datoteke biti otpremljene. Putanja je relativna u "
"odnosu na wp-contents fasciklu vašeg WordPress sajta. Putanja može biti "
"dinamička uključivanjem promenljivih kao što su %%username%% ili %%blogid%%. "
"Pogledajte Dokumentaciju o tome kako se koriste promenljive unutar "
"uploadpath."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:845
msgid "Plugin Fit Mode"
msgstr "Režim uklapanja dodatka"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:849
msgid "Fixed"
msgstr "Fiksno"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:849
msgid "Responsive"
msgstr "Responzivno"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:857
msgid ""
"This defines how the plugin's elements will fit inside the page/post. If it "
"is set to fixed, then the plugin's element positions will remain fixed no "
"matter the width of the container page/post. If it is set to responsive, "
"then the plugin's elements will wrap to fit the width of the container page/"
"post."
msgstr ""
"Ovo definiše kako će se elementi dodatka uklopiti unutar stranice/objave. "
"Ako je postavljeno na fixed, pozicije elemenata dodatka ostaće fiksne bez "
"obzira na širinu stranice/objave kontejnera. Ako je postavljeno na "
"responsive, elementi dodatka će se prelomiti da se uklope u širinu stranice/"
"objave kontejnera."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:860
msgid "Allow No File"
msgstr "Dozvoli bez datoteke"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:872
msgid ""
"When it is activated a user can submit the upload form even if a file is not "
"selected."
msgstr ""
"Kada je aktivirano, korisnik može poslati formu za otpremanje čak i ako "
"datoteka nije izabrana."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:875
msgid "Reset Form Mode"
msgstr "Režim resetovanja obrasca"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:879
msgid "Always"
msgstr "Uvek"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:879
msgid "On Success"
msgstr "Pri uspehu"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:879
msgid "Never"
msgstr "Nikada"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:887
msgid ""
"It defines whether the form will be reset after upload; 'always' means that "
"it will be reset in any case, 'onsuccess' means that it will be reset only "
"if upload was successful, 'never' means that it will never be reset."
msgstr ""
"Definiše da li će forma biti resetovana nakon otpremanja; 'always' znači da "
"će biti resetovana u svakom slučaju, 'onsuccess' znači da će biti resetovana "
"samo ako je otpremanje bilo uspešno, 'never' znači da nikada neće biti "
"resetovana."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:890
msgid "Upload Roles"
msgstr "Uloge otpremanja"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:902
msgid ""
"Defines the categories (roles) of users allowed to upload files. Multiple "
"selections can be made. If 'Select All' is checked, then all logged users "
"can upload files. If 'Include Guests' is checked, then guests (not logged "
"users) can also upload files. Default value is 'all,guests'."
msgstr ""
"Definiše kategorije (uloge) korisnika kojima je dozvoljeno da otpremaju "
"datoteke. Može se napraviti više izbora. Ako je označeno 'Izaberi sve', svi "
"prijavljeni korisnici mogu da otpremaju datoteke. Ako je označeno 'Uključi "
"goste', gosti (neprijavljeni korisnici) takođe mogu da otpremaju datoteke. "
"Podrazumevana vrednost je 'all,guests'."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:905
msgid "Allowed File Extensions"
msgstr "Dozvoljene ekstenzije datoteka"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:917
msgid ""
"Defines the allowed file extensions. Multiple extentions can be defined, "
"separated with comma (,)."
msgstr ""
"Definiše dozvoljene ekstenzije datoteka. Više ekstenzija se može definisati, "
"razdvojenih zarezom (,)."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:920
msgid "Allowed File Size"
msgstr "Dozvoljena veličina datoteke"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:932
msgid ""
"Defines the allowed file size in MBytes. Files larger than maxsize will not "
"be uploaded. Floating point numbers can be used (e.g. '2.5')."
msgstr ""
"Definiše dozvoljenu veličinu datoteke u MBajtima. Datoteke veće od maxsize "
"neće biti otpremljene. Mogu se koristiti brojevi sa pokretnim zarezom (npr. "
"'2.5')."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:935
msgid "Create Upload Path"
msgstr "Kreiraj putanju za otpremanje"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:947
msgid ""
"If activated then the plugin will attempt to create the upload path, if it "
"does not exist."
msgstr ""
"Ako je aktivirano, dodatak će pokušati da kreira putanju za otpremanje, ako "
"ne postoji."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:950
msgid "Do Not Change Filename"
msgstr "Ne menjaj naziv datoteke"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:962
msgid ""
"The plugin by default will modify the filename if it contains invalid or non-"
"english characters. By enabling this attribute the plugin will not change "
"the filename."
msgstr ""
"Dodatak će podrazumevano izmeniti naziv datoteke ako sadrži nevažeće ili ne-"
"engleske znakove. Omogućavanjem ovog atributa dodatak neće menjati naziv "
"datoteke."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:965
msgid "Folder Access Method"
msgstr "Metod pristupa fascikli"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:969
msgid "Normal"
msgstr "Normalno"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:977
msgid ""
"Some times files cannot be uploaded to the upload folder because of read/"
"write permissions. A workaround is to use ftp to transfer the files, however "
"ftp credentials must be declared, so use carefully and only if necessary."
msgstr ""
"Ponekad datoteke ne mogu biti otpremljene u fasciklu za otpremanje zbog "
"dozvola za čitanje/pisanje. Rešenje je da se koristi ftp za prenos datoteka, "
"međutim ftp akreditivi moraju biti navedeni, pa koristite pažljivo i samo "
"ako je neophodno."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:980
msgid "FTP Access Credentials"
msgstr "FTP akreditivi za pristup"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:992
msgid ""
"If FTP access method is selected, then FTP credentials must be declared "
"here, in the form username:password@ftpdomain:port, e.g. "
"myusername:mypass@ftpdomain.com:80. Port can be ommitted. The user can "
"select Secure FTP (SFTP) by putting the prefix 's' before the port number, "
"e.g. myusername:mypass@ftpdomain.com:s22, or FTP over TLS (FTPS) by putting "
"the suffix 's' after the port number, e.g. "
"myusername:mypass@ftpdomain.com:21s (in this case a port number must be "
"defined)."
msgstr ""
"Ako je izabran FTP metod pristupa, FTP akreditivi moraju biti navedeni ovde, "
"u obliku username:password@ftpdomain:port, npr. "
"myusername:mypass@ftpdomain.com:80. Port se može izostaviti. Korisnik može "
"izabrati Secure FTP (SFTP) stavljanjem prefiksa 's' ispred broja porta, npr. "
"myusername:mypass@ftpdomain.com:s22, ili FTP preko TLS-a (FTPS) stavljanjem "
"sufiksa 's' iza broja porta, npr. myusername:mypass@ftpdomain.com:21s (u "
"ovom slučaju broj porta mora biti definisan)."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:995
msgid "Use FTP Domain"
msgstr "Koristi FTP domen"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1007
msgid ""
"If FTP access method is selected, then sometimes the FTP domain is different "
"than the domain of your Wordpress installation. In this case, enable this "
"attribute if upload of files is not successful."
msgstr ""
"Ako je izabran FTP metod pristupa, ponekad je FTP domen drugačiji od domena "
"vaše WordPress instalacije. U ovom slučaju, omogućite ovaj atribut ako "
"otpremanje datoteka nije uspešno."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1010
msgid "FTP Passive Mode"
msgstr "FTP pasivni režim"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1022
msgid ""
"If files fail to upload to the ftp domain then switching to passive FTP mode "
"may solve the problem."
msgstr ""
"Ako datoteke ne mogu da se otpreme na ftp domen, prelazak na pasivni FTP "
"režim može rešiti problem."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1025
msgid "Permissions of Uploaded File"
msgstr "Dozvole otpremljene datoteke"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1037
msgid ""
"Force the uploaded files to have specific permissions. This is a 4-digit "
"octal number, e.g. 0777. If left empty, then the ftp server will define the "
"permissions."
msgstr ""
"Primoraj otpremljene datoteke da imaju određene dozvole. Ovo je 4-cifreni "
"oktalni broj, npr. 0777. Ako se ostavi prazno, ftp server će definisati "
"dozvole."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1040
msgid "Show Upload Folder Path"
msgstr "Prikaži putanju fascikle za otpremanje"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1052
msgid "It defines if a label with the upload directory will be shown."
msgstr ""
"Definiše da li će biti prikazana oznaka sa direktorijumom za otpremanje."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1055
msgid "Select Subfolder"
msgstr "Odaberi podfasciklu"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1067
msgid ""
"If enabled then user can select the upload folder from a drop down list. The "
"list is defined in subfoldertree attribute. The folder paths are relative to "
"the path defined in uploadpath."
msgstr ""
"Ako je omogućeno, korisnik može izabrati fasciklu za otpremanje sa padajuće "
"liste. Lista je definisana u atributu subfoldertree. Putanje fascikli su "
"relativne u odnosu na putanju definisanu u uploadpath."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1070
msgid "List of Subfolders"
msgstr "Lista podfascikli"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1082
msgid ""
"The list of folders a user can select. Please see documentation on how to "
"create the list of folders. If 'Auto-populate list' is selected, then the "
"list will be filled automatically with the first-level subfolders inside the "
"directory defined by uploadpath. If 'List is editable' is selected, then the "
"user will have the capability to type the subfolder and filter the subfolder "
"list and/or define a new subfolder."
msgstr ""
"Lista fascikli koje korisnik može izabrati. Pogledajte dokumentaciju o tome "
"kako da kreirate listu fascikli. Ako je izabrano 'Automatski popuni listu', "
"lista će biti automatski popunjena podfasciklama prvog nivoa unutar "
"direktorijuma definisanog u uploadpath. Ako je izabrano 'Lista je "
"izmenjiva', korisnik će imati mogućnost da otkuca podfasciklu i filtrira "
"listu podfascikli i/ili definiše novu podfasciklu."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1085
msgid "File Duplicates Policy"
msgstr "Politika duplikata datoteka"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1089
msgid "Overwrite"
msgstr "Prepiši"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1089
msgid "Reject"
msgstr "Odbij"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1089
msgid "Maintain Both"
msgstr "Zadrži oba"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1097
msgid ""
"It determines what happens when an uploaded file has the same name with an "
"existing file. The uploaded file can overwrite the existing one, be rejected "
"or both can be kept by renaming the uploaded file according to a rule "
"defined in uniquepattern attribute."
msgstr ""
"Određuje šta se dešava kada otpremljena datoteka ima isti naziv kao "
"postojeća datoteka. Otpremljena datoteka može prepisati postojeću, biti "
"odbijena ili se obe mogu zadržati preimenovanjem otpremljene datoteke prema "
"pravilu definisanom u atributu uniquepattern."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1100
msgid "File Rename Rule"
msgstr "Pravilo preimenovanja datoteke"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1104
msgid "Index"
msgstr "Indeks"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1104
msgid "Datetime Stamp"
msgstr "Vremenska oznaka"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1112
msgid ""
"If duplicatespolicy is set to 'maintain both', then this rule defines how "
"the uploaded file will be renamed, in order not to match an existing file. "
"An incremental index number or a datetime stamp can be included in the "
"uploaded file name to make it unique."
msgstr ""
"Ako je duplicatespolicy postavljen na 'maintain both', ovo pravilo definiše "
"kako će otpremljena datoteka biti preimenovana, da ne bi odgovarala "
"postojećoj datoteci. Inkrementalni indeksni broj ili vremenska oznaka mogu "
"biti uključeni u naziv otpremljene datoteke da bi bio jedinstven."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1115
msgid "Redirect after Upload"
msgstr "Preusmeri nakon otpremanja"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1127
msgid ""
"If enabled, the user will be redirected to a url defined in redirectlink "
"attribute upon successful upload of all the files."
msgstr ""
"Ako je omogućeno, korisnik će biti preusmeren na url definisan u atributu "
"redirectlink nakon uspešnog otpremanja svih datoteka."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1130
msgid "Redirection URL"
msgstr "URL preusmeravanja"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1142
msgid ""
"This is the redirect URL. The URL can be dynamic by using variables. Please "
"see Documentation on how to use variables inside attributes."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je URL preusmeravanja. URL može biti dinamički korišćenjem promenljivih. "
"Pogledajte Dokumentaciju o tome kako se koriste promenljive unutar atributa."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1145
msgid "Show Detailed Admin Messages"
msgstr "Prikaži detaljne administratorske poruke"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1157
msgid ""
"If enabled then more detailed messages about upload operations will be shown "
"to administrators for debugging or error detection."
msgstr ""
"Ako je omogućeno, detaljnije poruke o operacijama otpremanja biće prikazane "
"administratorima za otklanjanje grešaka ili otkrivanje grešaka."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1160
msgid "Block Themes Compatibility Mode"
msgstr "Režim kompatibilnosti sa blok temama"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1164
msgid "Auto"
msgstr "Auto"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1172
msgid ""
"It determines the compatibility mode for block themes. If 'auto' is selected "
"the plugin will auto-detect if the theme is block based and will adapt its "
"output accordingly. If 'on' is selected the plugin will always consider that "
"the theme is block based. If 'off' is selected there will be no adaptation "
"for block based themes."
msgstr ""
"Određuje režim kompatibilnosti za blok teme. Ako je izabrano 'auto', dodatak "
"će automatski otkriti da li je tema zasnovana na blokovima i prilagodiće "
"svoj izlaz u skladu s tim. Ako je izabrano 'on', dodatak će uvek smatrati da "
"je tema zasnovana na blokovima. Ako je izabrano 'off', neće biti "
"prilagođavanja za teme zasnovane na blokovima."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1175
msgid "Disable AJAX"
msgstr "Onemogući AJAX"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1187
msgid ""
"If AJAX is disabled, then upload of files will be performed using HTML "
"forms, meaning that page will refresh to complete the upload. Use it in case "
"that AJAX is causing problems with your page (although the plugin has an "
"auto-detection feature for checking if user's browser supports AJAX or not)."
msgstr ""
"Ako je AJAX onemogućen, otpremanje datoteka biće izvršeno korišćenjem HTML "
"formi, što znači da će se stranica osvežiti da završi otpremanje. Koristite "
"u slučaju da AJAX izaziva probleme sa vašom stranicom (iako dodatak ima "
"funkciju automatskog otkrivanja za proveru da li pregledač korisnika "
"podržava AJAX ili ne)."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1190 lib/wfu_constants.php:217
msgid "Test Mode"
msgstr "Režim testiranja"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1202
msgid ""
"If enabled then the plugin will be shown in test mode, meaning that all "
"selected features will be shown but no upload will be possible. Use it to "
"review how the plugin looks like and style it according to your needs."
msgstr ""
"Ako je omogućeno, dodatak će biti prikazan u režimu testiranja, što znači da "
"će sve izabrane funkcije biti prikazane, ali nijedno otpremanje neće biti "
"moguće. Koristite ga da pregledate kako dodatak izgleda i stilizujete ga "
"prema svojim potrebama."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1205
msgid "Debug Mode"
msgstr "Režim otklanjanja grešaka"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1217
msgid ""
"If enabled then the plugin will show to administrators any internal PHP "
"warnings and errors generated during the upload process inside the message "
"box."
msgstr ""
"Ako je omogućeno, dodatak će administratorima prikazati sva interna PHP "
"upozorenja i greške generisane tokom procesa otpremanja unutar polja za "
"poruke."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1232
msgid ""
"It defines the positions of the selected plugin components. Drag the "
"components from the right pane and drop them to the left one to define your "
"own component positions."
msgstr ""
"Definiše pozicije izabranih komponenti dodatka. Prevucite komponente iz "
"desnog okna i otpustite ih u levo da biste definisali svoje pozicije "
"komponenti."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1235
msgid "Plugin Title"
msgstr "Naslov dodatka"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1247
msgid "A text representing the title of the plugin."
msgstr "Tekst koji predstavlja naslov dodatka."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1250
msgid "Select Button Caption"
msgstr "Natpis dugmeta za izbor"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1262
msgid "The caption of the button that selects the files for upload."
msgstr "Natpis dugmeta koje bira datoteke za otpremanje."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1265
msgid "Upload Button Caption"
msgstr "Natpis dugmeta za otpremanje"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1277
msgid "The caption of the button that starts the upload."
msgstr "Natpis dugmeta koje započinje otpremanje."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1292
msgid ""
"This is the label before the upload folder path, if the path is selected to "
"be shown using the showtargetfolder attribute."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je oznaka pre putanje fascikle za otpremanje, ako je putanja izabrana da "
"se prikaže pomoću atributa showtargetfolder."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1295
msgid "Select Subfolder Label"
msgstr "Oznaka izbora podfascikle"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1307
msgid ""
"This is the label of the subfolder dropdown list. It is active when "
"askforsubfolders attribute is on."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je oznaka padajuće liste podfascikli. Aktivna je kada je atribut "
"askforsubfolders uključen."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1310
msgid "Success Upload Message"
msgstr "Poruka o uspešnom otpremanju"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1322
msgid ""
"This is the message that will be shown for every file that has been uploaded "
"successfully."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je poruka koja će biti prikazana za svaku datoteku koja je uspešno "
"otpremljena."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1325
msgid "Warning Upload Message"
msgstr "Poruka upozorenja o otpremanju"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1337
msgid ""
"This is the message that will be shown for every file that has been uploaded "
"with warnings."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je poruka koja će biti prikazana za svaku datoteku koja je otpremljena "
"sa upozorenjima."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1340
msgid "Error Upload Message"
msgstr "Poruka o grešci otpremanja"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1352
msgid ""
"This is the message that will be shown for every file that has failed to "
"upload."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je poruka koja će biti prikazana za svaku datoteku koja nije otpremljena."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1355
msgid "Wait Upload Message"
msgstr "Poruka čekanja otpremanja"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1367
msgid "This is the message that will be shown while file is uploading."
msgstr "Ovo je poruka koja će biti prikazana dok se datoteka otprema."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1370
msgid "Upload Media Button Caption"
msgstr "Natpis dugmeta za otpremanje medija"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1382
msgid ""
"The caption of the button that starts the upload when media capture from the "
"webcam has been activated."
msgstr ""
"Natpis dugmeta koje započinje otpremanje kada je aktivirano snimanje medija "
"sa veb kamere."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1385
msgid "Video Filename"
msgstr "Naziv video datoteke"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1397
msgid "This is the file name of the captured video file."
msgstr "Ovo je naziv snimljene video datoteke."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1400
msgid "Image Filename"
msgstr "Naziv datoteke slike"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1412
msgid "This is the file name of the captured image file."
msgstr "Ovo je naziv snimljene datoteke slike."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1415
msgid "Required Fields Suffix"
msgstr "Sufiks obaveznih polja"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1427
msgid ""
"This is the keyword that shows up next to user field labels in order to "
"denote that they are required."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je ključna reč koja se pojavljuje pored oznaka korisničkih polja da bi "
"označila da su obavezna."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1430
msgid "Notify by Email"
msgstr "Obavesti putem imejla"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1442
msgid ""
"If activated then email will be sent to inform about successful file uploads."
msgstr ""
"Ako je aktivirano, imejl će biti poslat da obavesti o uspešnim otpremanjima "
"datoteka."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1445
msgid "Email Recipients"
msgstr "Primaoci imejla"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1457
msgid ""
"Defines the recipients of the email notification. Can be dynamic by using "
"variables. Please check Documentation on how to use variables in atributes."
msgstr ""
"Definiše primaoce obaveštenja putem imejla. Može biti dinamički korišćenjem "
"promenljivih. Pogledajte Dokumentaciju o tome kako se koriste promenljive u "
"atributima."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1460
msgid "Email Headers"
msgstr "Zaglavlja imejla"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1472
msgid ""
"Defines additional email headers, in case you want to sent an HTML message, "
"or use Bcc list, or use a different From address and name or other more "
"advanced email options."
msgstr ""
"Definiše dodatna zaglavlja imejla, u slučaju da želite da pošaljete HTML "
"poruku, ili koristite Bcc listu, ili koristite drugačiju From adresu i ime "
"ili druge naprednije opcije imejla."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1475
msgid "Email Subject"
msgstr "Naslov imejla"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1487
msgid ""
"Defines the email subject. Can be dynamic by using variables. Please check "
"Documentation on how to use variables in atributes."
msgstr ""
"Definiše naslov imejla. Može biti dinamički korišćenjem promenljivih. "
"Pogledajte Dokumentaciju o tome kako se koriste promenljive u atributima."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1490
msgid "Email Body"
msgstr "Telo imejla"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1502
msgid ""
"Defines the email body. Can be dynamic by using variables. Please check "
"Documentation on how to use variables in atributes."
msgstr ""
"Definiše telo imejla. Može biti dinamički korišćenjem promenljivih. "
"Pogledajte Dokumentaciju o tome kako se koriste promenljive u atributima."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1505
msgid "Attach Uploaded Files"
msgstr "Priloži otpremljene datoteke"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1517
msgid ""
"If activated, then uploaded files will be included in the notification email "
"as attachments. Please use carefully."
msgstr ""
"Ako je aktivirano, otpremljene datoteke biće uključene u imejl obaveštenja "
"kao prilozi. Koristite pažljivo."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1520
msgid "Ask for Consent"
msgstr "Zatraži saglasnost"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1532
msgid ""
"If activated, then consent from users will be asked for storing their "
"personal data. If users do not give consent, then their data will not be "
"stored in the database, they will only be included in the notification "
"email, if email notifications are active."
msgstr ""
"Ako je aktivirano, tražiće se saglasnost korisnika za čuvanje njihovih "
"ličnih podataka. Ako korisnici ne daju saglasnost, njihovi podaci neće biti "
"sačuvani u bazi podataka, biće samo uključeni u imejl obaveštenja, ako su "
"imejl obaveštenja aktivna."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1535
msgid "Personal Data Types"
msgstr "Tipovi ličnih podataka"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1539
msgid "Userdata and files"
msgstr "Podaci o korisniku i datoteke"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1547
msgid ""
"Determines which data are considered as personal data. By default only "
"userdata are considered as personal data. If the 2nd option is selected, "
"then files will also be considered as personal data. This means that if the "
"users do not give their consent, then the files will not be uploaded on the "
"website, they will only be inluded in the notification email as attachments, "
"if email notifications are active."
msgstr ""
"Određuje koji podaci se smatraju ličnim podacima. Podrazumevano se samo "
"korisnički podaci smatraju ličnim podacima. Ako je izabrana 2. opcija, i "
"datoteke će se smatrati ličnim podacima. To znači da ako korisnici ne daju "
"svoju saglasnost, datoteke neće biti otpremljene na sajt, biće samo "
"uključene u imejl obaveštenja kao prilozi, ako su imejl obaveštenja aktivna."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1550
msgid "Do Not Remember Consent Answer"
msgstr "Ne pamti odgovor o saglasnosti"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1562
msgid ""
"If activated the plugin will not remember the consent answer provided by the "
"user and the consent question will always show."
msgstr ""
"Ako je aktivirano, dodatak neće pamtiti odgovor o saglasnosti koji je dao "
"korisnik i pitanje o saglasnosti će se uvek prikazivati."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1565
msgid "Consent Denial Rejects Upload"
msgstr "Odbijanje saglasnosti odbija otpremanje"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1577
msgid ""
"If activated and user has denied consent then the upload will be rejected. "
"If deactivated, then the upload will continue regardless of consent answer."
msgstr ""
"Ako je aktivirano i korisnik je odbio saglasnost, otpremanje će biti "
"odbijeno. Ako je deaktivirano, otpremanje će se nastaviti bez obzira na "
"odgovor o saglasnosti."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1580
msgid "Reject Message"
msgstr "Poruka o odbijanju"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1592
msgid ""
"It defines the message that will appear to the user if upload cannot "
"continue due to consent denial."
msgstr ""
"Definiše poruku koja će se pojaviti korisniku ako otpremanje ne može da se "
"nastavi zbog odbijanja saglasnosti."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1595
msgid "Consent Format"
msgstr "Format saglasnosti"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1599
msgid "Radio"
msgstr "Radio dugme"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1599
msgid "Prompt"
msgstr "Dijalog"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1607
msgid ""
"Determines how consent question will appear to the user. If 'checkbox' is "
"selected then a checkbox will appear inside the upload form which the user "
"needs to tick. If 'radio' is selected then a radio button with 'Yes' and "
"'No' answers will appear inside the form (this makes sure that the user will "
"select something after all. If 'prompt' is selected then a dialog will "
"appear on the user when pressing the upload button asking for consent."
msgstr ""
"Određuje kako će se pitanje o saglasnosti pojaviti korisniku. Ako je "
"izabrano 'checkbox', polje za potvrdu će se pojaviti unutar forme za "
"otpremanje koje korisnik treba da označi. Ako je izabrano 'radio', radio "
"dugme sa odgovorima 'Da' i 'Ne' pojaviće se unutar forme (ovo osigurava da "
"će korisnik na kraju nešto izabrati). Ako je izabrano 'prompt', dijalog će "
"se pojaviti korisniku prilikom pritiska na dugme za otpremanje tražeći "
"saglasnost."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1610
msgid "Preselected Answer"
msgstr "Unapred izabran odgovor"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1614
msgid "None"
msgstr "Nijedan"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1622
msgid "Determines whether a default answer will be selected."
msgstr "Određuje da li će podrazumevani odgovor biti izabran."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1625
msgid "Consent Question for Checkbox"
msgstr "Pitanje o saglasnosti za polje za potvrdu"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1637
msgid ""
"Defines the question that will appear to the user next to the checkbox, or "
"radio buttons or inside the prompt dialog. If a word starting and ending "
"with semicolon (:) is added in the question, e.g. :link:, then it will be "
"replaced by a link defined in 'Consent Disclaimer Link' attribute. This way "
"a link to a disclaimer can be added."
msgstr ""
"Definiše pitanje koje će se pojaviti korisniku pored polja za potvrdu, ili "
"radio dugmadi ili unutar dijaloga. Ako se u pitanje doda reč koja počinje i "
"završava se dvotačkom (:), npr. :link:, biće zamenjena linkom definisanim u "
"atributu 'Link za izjavu o saglasnosti'. Na ovaj način se može dodati link "
"ka izjavi."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1640
msgid "Consent Disclaimer Link"
msgstr "Link za izjavu o saglasnosti"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1652
msgid ""
"Defines a link that displays a disclaimer to the user if the user presses "
"the relevant link that is included inside the consent question."
msgstr ""
"Definiše link koji prikazuje izjavu korisniku ako korisnik pritisne "
"odgovarajući link koji je uključen unutar pitanja o saglasnosti."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1655
msgid "Enable Material UI"
msgstr "Omogući Material UI"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1667
msgid ""
"If enabled the upload form will use Material UI components. Default is false."
msgstr ""
"Ako je omogućeno, forma za otpremanje će koristiti Material UI komponente. "
"Podrazumevano je false."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1670
msgid "Material UI Primary Color"
msgstr "Primarna boja Material UI"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1682
msgid "The Material UI theme primary color."
msgstr "Primarna boja Material UI teme."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1685
msgid "Material UI Text Color"
msgstr "Boja teksta Material UI"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1697
msgid "The Material UI theme text primary color."
msgstr "Primarna boja teksta Material UI teme."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1700
msgid "Material UI Error Color"
msgstr "Boja greške Material UI"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1712
msgid "The Material UI theme error color."
msgstr "Boja greške Material UI teme."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1715
msgid "Material UI Dark Mode"
msgstr "Tamni režim Material UI"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1727
msgid "If enabled Material UI will turn to dark theme."
msgstr "Ako je omogućeno, Material UI će preći na tamnu temu."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1730
msgid "Override CSS Method"
msgstr "Metod zamene CSS-a"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1734
msgid "Strong Styles To Selected"
msgstr "Jaki stilovi za izabrane"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1734
msgid "Strong Styles To All"
msgstr "Jaki stilovi za sve"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1734
msgid "Layers"
msgstr "Slojevi"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1734
msgid "Shadow DOM"
msgstr "Shadow DOM"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1742
msgid ""
"The Material UI components require specific CSS. However the theme's and "
"other loaded styles may override them, causing the components not to show "
"correctly. The plugin uses some methods to override the loaded styles. The "
"first method, 'strongstyles-selected', makes the CSS selectors of some "
"Material UI styles more specific. The second method, 'strongstyles-all', "
"makes the CSS selectors of all Material UI styles more specific. The third "
"method, 'layers' uses CSS cascading layers to increase the precendence of "
"Material UI styles. The fourth method puts all Material UI components and "
"their styles in Shadow DOM."
msgstr ""
"Material UI komponente zahtevaju specifičan CSS. Međutim, stilovi teme i "
"drugi učitani stilovi mogu ih zameniti, uzrokujući da se komponente ne "
"prikazuju ispravno. Dodatak koristi neke metode za zamenu učitanih stilova. "
"Prvi metod, 'strongstyles-selected', čini CSS selektore nekih Material UI "
"stilova specifičnijim. Drugi metod, 'strongstyles-all', čini CSS selektore "
"svih Material UI stilova specifičnijim. Treći metod, 'layers', koristi CSS "
"kaskadne slojeve da poveća prioritet Material UI stilova. Četvrti metod "
"stavlja sve Material UI komponente i njihove stilove u Shadow DOM."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1760
msgid "Success Message Colors"
msgstr "Boje poruke o uspehu"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1772
msgid ""
"It defines the text, background and border color of the success message."
msgstr "Definiše boju teksta, pozadine i ivice poruke o uspehu."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1775
msgid "Warning Message Colors"
msgstr "Boje poruke upozorenja"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1787
msgid ""
"It defines the text, background and border color of the warning message."
msgstr "Definiše boju teksta, pozadine i ivice poruke upozorenja."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1790
msgid "Fail Message Colors"
msgstr "Boje poruke o neuspehu"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1802
msgid ""
"It defines the text, background and border color of the fail (error) message."
msgstr "Definiše boju teksta, pozadine i ivice poruke o neuspehu (grešci)."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1832
msgid "It defines the widths of the selected plugin components."
msgstr "Definiše širine izabranih komponenti dodatka."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1847
msgid "It defines the heights of the selected plugin components."
msgstr "Definiše visine izabranih komponenti dodatka."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1850
msgid "Include Additional Data Fields"
msgstr "Uključi dodatna polja podataka"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1862
msgid ""
"If enabled, then user can send additional information together with uploaded "
"files (e.g. name, email etc), defined in userdatalabel attribute."
msgstr ""
"Ako je omogućeno, korisnik može poslati dodatne informacije zajedno sa "
"otpremljenim datotekama (npr. ime, imejl itd.), definisane u atributu "
"userdatalabel."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1877
msgid ""
"It defines the labels of the additional data fields and whether they are "
"required or not."
msgstr "Definiše oznake dodatnih polja podataka i da li su obavezna ili ne."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1880
msgid "WP Filebase Plugin Connection"
msgstr "Povezivanje sa WP Filebase dodatkom"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1892
msgid ""
"If enabled then the WP Filebase Plugin will be informed about new file "
"uploads."
msgstr ""
"Ako je omogućeno, WP Filebase dodatak biće obavešten o novim otpremanjima "
"datoteka."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1895
msgid "Add Uploaded Files To Media"
msgstr "Dodaj otpremljene datoteke u Mediju"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1907
msgid ""
"If enabled then the uploaded files will be added to the Media library of "
"your Wordpress website. Please note that the upload path must be inside the "
"wp-content/uploads directory (which is the default upload path)."
msgstr ""
"Ako je omogućeno, otpremljene datoteke biće dodate u Biblioteku medija vašeg "
"WordPress sajta. Imajte na umu da putanja za otpremanje mora biti unutar "
"direktorijuma wp-content/uploads (koji je podrazumevana putanja za "
"otpremanje)."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1910
msgid "Attach Uploaded Files To Post"
msgstr "Priloži otpremljene datoteke uz objavu"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1922
msgid ""
"If enabled then the uploaded files will be added to the current post as "
"attachments. Please note that the upload path must be inside the wp-content/"
"uploads directory (which is the default upload path)."
msgstr ""
"Ako je omogućeno, otpremljene datoteke biće dodate trenutnoj objavi kao "
"prilozi. Imajte na umu da putanja za otpremanje mora biti unutar "
"direktorijuma wp-content/uploads (koji je podrazumevana putanja za "
"otpremanje)."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1925
msgid "Enable Webcam"
msgstr "Omogući veb kameru"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1937
msgid ""
"This enables capturing of video or still pictures from the computer's "
"webcam. It is not supported by all browsers yet."
msgstr ""
"Ovo omogućava snimanje videa ili fotografija sa veb kamere računara. Još "
"uvek ga ne podržavaju svi pregledači."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1940
msgid "Allow File Selection"
msgstr "Dozvoli izbor datoteka"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1952
msgid ""
"When webcam mode is enabled, the user can only capture video or images from "
"the webcam. If this attribute is enabled, the user can also select an image "
"file using the Select File button. The selected file will be previewed in "
"the capture box."
msgstr ""
"Kada je režim veb kamere omogućen, korisnik može samo da snima video ili "
"slike sa veb kamere. Ako je ovaj atribut omogućen, korisnik takođe može da "
"izabere datoteku slike pomoću dugmeta Izaberi datoteku. Izabrana datoteka "
"biće prikazana u polju za snimanje."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1955
msgid "Capture Mode"
msgstr "Režim snimanja"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1959
msgid "Capture Video"
msgstr "Snimi video"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1959
msgid "Take Photos"
msgstr "Snimi fotografije"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1959
msgid "Both"
msgstr "Oba"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1967
msgid ""
"It defines the webcam capture mode. The webcam can either capture video, "
"still photos or both."
msgstr ""
"Definiše režim snimanja veb kamere. Veb kamera može da snima video, "
"fotografije ili oboje."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1970
msgid "Capture Audio"
msgstr "Snimi zvuk"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1982
msgid ""
"It defines whether audio will be captured together with video from the "
"webcam."
msgstr "Definiše da li će zvuk biti snimljen zajedno sa videom sa veb kamere."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1985
msgid "Video Width"
msgstr "Širina videa"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:1997
msgid ""
"It requests a preferable video width for the webcam. The plugin will try to "
"match this setting as close as possible depending on webcam capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Zahteva željenu širinu videa za veb kameru. Dodatak će pokušati da uskladi "
"ovo podešavanje što je moguće bliže u zavisnosti od mogućnosti veb kamere."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:2000
msgid "Video Height"
msgstr "Visina videa"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:2012
msgid ""
"It requests a preferable video height for the webcam. The plugin will try to "
"match this setting as close as possible depending on webcam capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Zahteva željenu visinu videa za veb kameru. Dodatak će pokušati da uskladi "
"ovo podešavanje što je moguće bliže u zavisnosti od mogućnosti veb kamere."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:2015
msgid "Video Aspect Ratio"
msgstr "Odnos širine i visine videa"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:2027
msgid ""
"It requests a preferable video aspect ratio for the webcam. The plugin will "
"try to match this setting as close as possible depending on webcam "
"capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Zahteva željeni odnos širine i visine videa za veb kameru. Dodatak će "
"pokušati da uskladi ovo podešavanje što je moguće bliže u zavisnosti od "
"mogućnosti veb kamere."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:2030
msgid "Video Frame Rate"
msgstr "Broj kadrova videa"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:2042
msgid ""
"It requests a preferable video frame rate for video recording. The plugin "
"will try to match this setting as close as possible depending on webcam "
"capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Zahteva željeni broj kadrova videa za snimanje videa. Dodatak će pokušati da "
"uskladi ovo podešavanje što je moguće bliže u zavisnosti od mogućnosti veb "
"kamere."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:2045
msgid "Camera Facing Mode"
msgstr "Režim orijentacije kamere"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:2049
msgid "Any"
msgstr "Bilo koja"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:2049
msgid "Front"
msgstr "Prednja"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:2049
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Zadnja"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:2057
msgid ""
"It defines if the front or back camera will be preferred (for mobile devices "
"with 2 cameras). The plugin will try to match this setting depending on "
"webcam capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Definiše da li će prednja ili zadnja kamera biti preferirana (za mobilne "
"uređaje sa 2 kamere). Dodatak će pokušati da uskladi ovo podešavanje u "
"zavisnosti od mogućnosti veb kamere."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:2060
msgid "Start Camera Off"
msgstr "Pokreni kameru isključenu"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:2072
msgid "If enabled the camera will initially be off."
msgstr "Ako je omogućeno, kamera će inicijalno biti isključena."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:2075
msgid "Switch Camera Button"
msgstr "Dugme za promenu kamere"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:2087
msgid ""
"If enabled a button will show up at the top-left corner of the capture box, "
"for switching between front and back camera."
msgstr ""
"Ako je omogućeno, dugme će se pojaviti u gornjem levom uglu polja za "
"snimanje, za prebacivanje između prednje i zadnje kamere."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:2090
msgid "Max Record Time"
msgstr "Maks. vreme snimanja"

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:2102
msgid ""
"It defines the maximum time of video recording (in seconds). If it is set to "
"-1, then there is no time limit."
msgstr ""
"Definiše maksimalno vreme snimanja videa (u sekundama). Ako je postavljeno "
"na -1, nema vremenskog ograničenja."

#: lib/wfu_attributes.php:2117
msgid "It defines the background color of the webcam capture box."
msgstr "Definiše boju pozadine polja za snimanje veb kamere."

#. plugin default values
#: lib/wfu_constants.php:30
msgid "Upload files"
msgstr "Otpremi datoteke"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:31
msgid "Select File"
msgstr "Odaberi datoteku"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:32
msgid "Upload File"
msgstr "Otpremi datoteku"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:33
msgid "File Upload Notification"
msgstr "Obaveštenje o otpremanju datoteke"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:34
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Dear Recipient,%%n%%%%n%%   This is an automatic delivery message to notify "
"you that a new file has been uploaded.%%n%%%%n%%Best Regards"
msgstr ""
"Poštovani primaoče,%%n%%%%n%%   Ovo je automatska poruka o isporuci koja vas "
"obaveštava da je otpremljena nova datoteka.%%n%%%%n%%Srdačan pozdrav"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:35
#, php-format
msgid "File %%filename%% uploaded successfully"
msgstr "Datoteka %%filename%% je uspešno otpremljena"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:36
#, php-format
msgid "File %%filename%% uploaded successfully but with warnings"
msgstr "Datoteka %%filename%% je uspešno otpremljena, ali sa upozorenjima"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:37
#, php-format
msgid "File %%filename%% not uploaded"
msgstr "Datoteka %%filename%% nije otpremljena"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:38
#, php-format
msgid "File %%filename%% is being uploaded"
msgstr "Datoteka %%filename%% se otprema"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:39
msgid "Your message"
msgstr "Vaša poruka"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:40
msgid "Please fill in the above words: "
msgstr "Popunite sledećim rečima:"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:41
msgid "Upload Media"
msgstr "Otpremi medije"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:42
msgid "videostream"
msgstr "videozapis"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:43
msgid "screenshot"
msgstr "snimak ekrana"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:44
msgid ""
"By activating this option I agree to let the website keep my personal data"
msgstr "Aktiviranjem ove opcije pristajem da sajt zadrži moje lične podatke"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:45
msgid ""
"You have denied to let the website keep your personal data. Upload cannot "
"continue!"
msgstr ""
"Odbili ste da dozvolite sajtu da zadrži vaše lične podatke. Otpremanje ne "
"može da se nastavi!"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:59
msgid "Remove Remote"
msgstr "Ukloni udaljeno"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:60
msgid "Remove this remote file"
msgstr "Ukloni ovu udaljenu datoteku"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:61
msgid "Sort list based on this column"
msgstr "Sortiraj listu na osnovu ove kolone"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:62
msgid "guest"
msgstr "gost"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:63
msgid "unknown"
msgstr "nepoznato"

#. error messages
#: lib/wfu_constants.php:65
msgid ""
"Error. Could not resolve ftp target filedir. Check the domain in 'ftpinfo' "
"attribute."
msgstr ""
"Greška. Ciljni direktorijum datoteke nije mogao biti razrešen. Proverite "
"domen u 'ftpinfo' atributu."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:66
msgid "Error. Invalid ftp information. Check 'ftpinfo' attribute."
msgstr "Greška. Nevažeći ftp podaci. Proverite 'ftpinfo' atribut."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:67
msgid ""
"Error. Could not extract ftp information from 'ftpinfo' attribute. Check its "
"syntax."
msgstr ""
"Greška. Neuspelo izvlačenje ftp podataka iz 'ftpinfo' atributa. Proverite "
"njegovu sintaksu. "

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:68
msgid ""
"Error. Could not resolve ftp target filename. Check the domain in 'ftpinfo' "
"attribute."
msgstr ""
"Greška. Ftp naziv ciljne datoteke nije mogao biti razrešen. Proverite domen "
"u 'ftpinfo' atributu."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:69
msgid ""
"Error. Could not open source file for ftp upload. Check if file is "
"accessible."
msgstr ""
"Greška. Nije moguće otvoriti izvornu datoteku za ftp otpremanje. Proverite "
"da li je datoteka dostupna."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:70
msgid "Error. Could not send data to ftp target file."
msgstr "Greška. Nije moguće poslati podatke ftp ciljnoj datoteci."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:71
msgid ""
"Error. Could not connect to ftp host. Check the domain in 'ftpinfo' "
"attribute."
msgstr ""
"Greška. Nije moguće povezati se sa ftp hostom. Proverite domen u atributu "
"'ftpinfo'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:72
msgid ""
"Error. Could not authenticate to ftp host. Check username and password in "
"'ftpinfo' attribute."
msgstr ""
"Greška. Nije moguće autentifikovati se na ftp host. Proverite korisničko ime "
"i lozinku u atributu 'ftpinfo'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:73
msgid ""
"Error. Could not initialize sftp subsystem. Please check if the server "
"supports sftp."
msgstr ""
"Greška. Nije moguće inicijalizovati sftp podsistem. Proverite da li server "
"podržava sftp."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:74
msgid "Error. The web server does not support sftp."
msgstr "Greška. Veb server ne podržava sftp."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:75
msgid "Error. The web server does not support ftps."
msgstr "Greška. Veb server ne podržava ftps."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:76
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Error. The upload size limit of PHP directive upload_max_filesize is "
"preventing the upload of big files.\n"
"PHP directive upload_max_filesize limit is: %s.\n"
"To increase the limit change the value of the directive from php.ini.\n"
"If you don't have access to php.ini, then try adding the following line to "
"your .htaccess file:\n"
"\n"
"php_value upload_max_filesize 10M\n"
"\n"
"(adjust the size according to your needs)\n"
"\n"
"The file .htaccess is found in your website root directory (where index.php "
"is found).\n"
"If your don't have this file, then create it.\n"
"If this does not work either, then contact your domain provider."
msgstr ""
"Greška. Ograničenje veličine otpremanja PHP direktive upload_max_filesize "
"sprečava otpremanje velikih datoteka.\n"
"Ograničenje PHP direktive upload_max_filesize je: %s.\n"
"Da povećate ograničenje, promenite vrednost direktive u php.ini.\n"
"Ako nemate pristup php.ini, pokušajte da dodate sledeću liniju u "
"vašu .htaccess datoteku:\n"
"\n"
"php_value upload_max_filesize 10M\n"
"\n"
"(prilagodite veličinu prema svojim potrebama)\n"
"\n"
"Datoteka .htaccess se nalazi u korenskom direktorijumu vašeg sajta (gde se "
"nalazi index.php).\n"
"Ako nemate ovu datoteku, kreirajte je.\n"
"Ako ni ovo ne uspe, kontaktirajte svog provajdera domena."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:77
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The upload time limit of PHP directive max_input_time is preventing the "
"upload of big files.\n"
"PHP directive max_input_time limit is: %s seconds.\n"
"To increase the limit change the value of the directive from php.ini.\n"
"If you don't have access to php.ini, then add the following line to "
"your .htaccess file:\n"
"\n"
"php_value max_input_time 500\n"
"\n"
"(adjust the time according to your needs)\n"
"\n"
"The file .htaccess is found in your website root directory (where index.php "
"is found).\n"
"If your don't have this file, then create it.\n"
"If this does not work either, then contact your domain provider."
msgstr ""
"Ograničenje vremena otpremanja PHP direktive max_input_time sprečava "
"otpremanje velikih datoteka.\n"
"Ograničenje PHP direktive max_input_time je: %s sekundi.\n"
"Da povećate ograničenje, promenite vrednost direktive u php.ini.\n"
"Ako nemate pristup php.ini, dodajte sledeću liniju u vašu .htaccess "
"datoteku:\n"
"\n"
"php_value max_input_time 500\n"
"\n"
"(prilagodite vreme prema svojim potrebama)\n"
"\n"
"Datoteka .htaccess se nalazi u korenskom direktorijumu vašeg sajta (gde se "
"nalazi index.php).\n"
"Ako nemate ovu datoteku, kreirajte je.\n"
"Ako ni ovo ne uspe, kontaktirajte svog provajdera domena."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:78
msgid ""
"Error. Permission denied to write to target folder.\n"
"Check and correct read/write permissions of target folder."
msgstr ""
"Greška. Odbijena je dozvola za pisanje u ciljnoj fascikli. Proverite i "
"ispravite dozvole za čitanje/pisanje u ciljnoj fascikli. "

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:79
msgid ""
"Error. This file was rejected because its extension is not correct. Its "
