"The default state of debug mode of the uploader shortcode. It can be 'true' "
"or 'false'."
msgstr ""
"Podrazumevano stanje režima otklanjanja grešaka shortcode-a za otpremanje. "
"Može biti 'true' ili 'false'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:329
msgid "Default Element Widths"
msgstr "Podrazumevane širine elemenata"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:329
msgid ""
"The default widths of the elements of the uploader shortcode. It is a comma-"
"separated list of element widths."
msgstr ""
"Podrazumevane širine elemenata shortcode-a za otpremanje. To je lista širina "
"elemenata razdvojenih zarezom."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:330
msgid "Default Element Heights"
msgstr "Podrazumevane visine elemenata"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:330
msgid ""
"The default heights of the elements of the uploader shortcode. It is a comma-"
"separated list of element heights."
msgstr ""
"Podrazumevane visine elemenata shortcode-a za otpremanje. To je lista visina "
"elemenata razdvojenih zarezom."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:331
msgid "Default Element Placements"
msgstr "Podrazumevana pozicioniranja elemenata"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:331
msgid ""
"The default placements of the elements of the uploader shortcode. Check "
"plugin's support page for syntax."
msgstr ""
"Podrazumevana pozicioniranja elemenata shortcode-a za otpremanje. Pogledajte "
"stranicu podrške dodatka za sintaksu."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:332
msgid "Default User Fields State"
msgstr "Podrazumevano stanje korisničkih polja"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:332
msgid ""
"The default state of custom user fields of the uploader shortcode. It can be "
"'true' or 'false'."
msgstr ""
"Podrazumevano stanje prilagođenih korisničkih polja shortcode-a za "
"otpremanje. Može biti 'true' ili 'false'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:333
msgid "Default Add to Media State"
msgstr "Podrazumevano stanje dodavanja u Mediju"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:333
msgid ""
"The default state for adding files to Media of the uploader shortcode. It "
"can be 'true' or 'false'."
msgstr ""
"Podrazumevano stanje za dodavanje datoteka u Mediju shortcode-a za "
"otpremanje. Može biti 'true' ili 'false'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:334
msgid "Default Attachment to Post State"
msgstr "Podrazumevano stanje prilaganja uz objavu"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:334
msgid ""
"The default state for attaching files to current post of the uploader "
"shortcode. It can be 'true' or 'false'."
msgstr ""
"Podrazumevano stanje za prilaganje datoteka trenutnoj objavi shortcode-a za "
"otpremanje. Može biti 'true' ili 'false'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:335
msgid "Default Webcam State"
msgstr "Podrazumevano stanje veb kamere"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:335
msgid "The default state for webcam capture. It can be 'true' or 'false'."
msgstr ""
"Podrazumevano stanje za snimanje sa veb kamere. Može biti 'true' ili 'false'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:336
msgid "Default Allow File Selection"
msgstr "Podrazumevana dozvola izbora datoteka"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:336
msgid ""
"The default state for allowing file selection when webcam is active. It can "
"be 'true' or 'false'."
msgstr ""
"Podrazumevano stanje za dozvolu izbora datoteka kada je veb kamera aktivna. "
"Može biti 'true' ili 'false'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:337
msgid "Default Capture Audio State"
msgstr "Podrazumevano stanje snimanja zvuka"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:337
msgid ""
"The default state of audio capture. If it is set to 'true' then audio will "
"be captured, together with video from the webcam. It can be 'true' or "
"'false'."
msgstr ""
"Podrazumevano stanje snimanja zvuka. Ako je postavljeno na 'true', zvuk će "
"biti snimljen zajedno sa videom sa veb kamere. Može biti 'true' ili 'false'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:338
msgid "Default Webcam Mode"
msgstr "Podrazumevani režim veb kamere"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:338
msgid ""
"The default webcam capture mode. It can be 'capture video', 'take photos' or "
"'both'."
msgstr ""
"Podrazumevani režim snimanja veb kamere. Može biti 'capture video', 'take "
"photos' ili 'both'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:339
msgid "Default Video Width"
msgstr "Podrazumevana širina videa"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:339
msgid ""
"The default preferable video width for webcam capture. It can be any "
"positive integer in pixels."
msgstr ""
"Podrazumevana željena širina videa za snimanje sa veb kamere. Može biti bilo "
"koji pozitivan ceo broj u pikselima."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:340
msgid "Default Video Height"
msgstr "Podrazumevana visina videa"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:340
msgid ""
"The default preferable video height for webcam capture. It can be any "
"positive integer in pixels."
msgstr ""
"Podrazumevana željena visina videa za snimanje sa veb kamere. Može biti bilo "
"koji pozitivan ceo broj u pikselima."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:341
msgid "Default Video Aspect Ratio"
msgstr "Podrazumevani odnos širine i visine videa"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:341
msgid ""
"The default preferable video aspect ratio for webcam video capture. It can "
"be any positive value."
msgstr ""
"Podrazumevani željeni odnos širine i visine videa za snimanje videa sa veb "
"kamere. Može biti bilo koja pozitivna vrednost."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:342
msgid "Default Video Frame Rate"
msgstr "Podrazumevani broj kadrova videa"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:342
msgid ""
"The default preferable video frame rate for webcam video capture. It can be "
"any positive value in frames/sec."
msgstr ""
"Podrazumevani željeni broj kadrova videa za snimanje videa sa veb kamere. "
"Može biti bilo koja pozitivna vrednost u kadrovima/sek."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:343
msgid "Default Camera Facing Mode"
msgstr "Podrazumevani režim orijentacije kamere"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:343
msgid ""
"The default preferable camera to be used for video/screenshot capture. It "
"can be 'any', 'front' or 'back'."
msgstr ""
"Podrazumevana željena kamera koja će se koristiti za snimanje videa/snimka "
"ekrana. Može biti 'any', 'front' ili 'back'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:344
msgid "Default Start Camera Off State"
msgstr "Podrazumevano stanje pokretanja kamere isključene"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:344
msgid ""
"The default state of setting the camera off when started. It can be 'true' "
"or 'false'."
msgstr ""
"Podrazumevano stanje postavljanja kamere na isključeno pri pokretanju. Može "
"biti 'true' ili 'false'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:345
msgid "Default Switch Camera Button State"
msgstr "Podrazumevano stanje dugmeta za promenu kamere"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:345
msgid ""
"The default state of the switch camera button. It can be 'true' or 'false'."
msgstr ""
"Podrazumevano stanje dugmeta za promenu kamere. Može biti 'true' ili 'false'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:346
msgid "Default Maximum Record Time"
msgstr "Podrazumevano maksimalno vreme snimanja"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:346
msgid ""
"The default maximum video recording time in seconds. The default value is 10 "
"seconds."
msgstr ""
"Podrazumevano maksimalno vreme snimanja videa u sekundama. Podrazumevana "
"vrednost je 10 sekundi."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:347
msgid "Default Webcam Background Color"
msgstr "Podrazumevana boja pozadine veb kamere"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:347
msgid "The default webcam capture box background color. The default is black."
msgstr ""
"Podrazumevana boja pozadine polja za snimanje veb kamere. Podrazumevana je "
"crna."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:348
msgid "Default Ask Consent State"
msgstr "Podrazumevano stanje traženja saglasnosti"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:348
msgid ""
"The default state of personal data consent request. The default value is "
"false."
msgstr ""
"Podrazumevano stanje zahteva za saglasnost o ličnim podacima. Podrazumevana "
"vrednost je false."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:349
msgid "Default Personal Data Types"
msgstr "Podrazumevani tipovi ličnih podataka"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:349
msgid "The default personal data types. The default value is 'userdata'."
msgstr ""
"Podrazumevani tipovi ličnih podataka. Podrazumevana vrednost je 'userdata'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:350
msgid "Default Do Not Remember Consent Answer State"
msgstr "Podrazumevano stanje nepamćenja odgovora o saglasnosti"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:350
msgid ""
"The default state about remembering or not user's answer on consent "
"question. The default value is true."
msgstr ""
"Podrazumevano stanje o pamćenju ili nepamćenju odgovora korisnika na pitanje "
"o saglasnosti. Podrazumevana vrednost je true."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:351
msgid "Default Reject Upload on Consent Denial State"
msgstr "Podrazumevano stanje odbijanja otpremanja pri odbijanju saglasnosti"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:351
msgid ""
"The default state of continuing or rejecting the upload depending on consent "
"answer. The default value is true."
msgstr ""
"Podrazumevano stanje nastavljanja ili odbijanja otpremanja u zavisnosti od "
"odgovora o saglasnosti. Podrazumevana vrednost je true."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:352
msgid "Default Consent Format"
msgstr "Podrazumevani format saglasnosti"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:352
msgid ""
"The default format of consent question. The default value is 'checkbox'."
msgstr ""
"Podrazumevani format pitanja o saglasnosti. Podrazumevana vrednost je "
"'checkbox'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:353
msgid "Default Consent Preselect State"
msgstr "Podrazumevano stanje pre-izbora saglasnosti"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:353
msgid ""
"The default preselect state of consent question when checkbox format is "
"active. The default value is false."
msgstr ""
"Podrazumevano stanje pre-izbora pitanja o saglasnosti kada je format polja "
"za potvrdu aktivan. Podrazumevana vrednost je false."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:357
msgid "Plugin Debug Mode"
msgstr "Režim otklanjanja grešaka dodatka"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:357
msgid ""
"If DEBUG mode is activated then advanced hook of plugin's function can be "
"performed. This option may make the plugin slower, so use it very carefully. "
"It can be 'OFF' or 'ON'."
msgstr ""
"Ako je režim DEBUG aktiviran, mogu se izvršiti napredni hukovi funkcije "
"dodatka. Ova opcija može usporiti dodatak, pa je koristite veoma pažljivo. "
"Može biti 'OFF' ili 'ON'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:358
msgid "Restrict Front-End Loading"
msgstr "Ograniči učitavanje na front-endu"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:358
msgid ""
"It defines whether the plugin will load on all pages or specific ones. If it "
"is 'false' then it will load on all pages. To restrict loading only on "
"specific pages set a comma-separated list of page or post IDs."
msgstr ""
"Definiše da li će se dodatak učitati na svim stranicama ili samo na "
"određenim. Ako je 'false', učitaće se na svim stranicama. Da ograničite "
"učitavanje samo na određene stranice, postavite listu ID-ova stranica ili "
"objava razdvojenih zarezom."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:359
msgid "Upload Progress Mode"
msgstr "Režim napretka otpremanja"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:359
msgid ""
"Defines how the upload progress is calculated. It can be 'incremental' or "
"'absolute'. Default value is 'incremental'."
msgstr ""
"Definiše kako se izračunava napredak otpremanja. Može biti 'incremental' ili "
"'absolute'. Podrazumevana vrednost je 'incremental'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:360
msgid "External Templates Folder"
msgstr "Fascikla eksternih šablona"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:360
msgid ""
"Defines the external templates folder, relative to /wp-content. If it is "
"empty then no external templates folder will be used to search for templates."
msgstr ""
"Definiše fasciklu eksternih šablona, relativnu u odnosu na /wp-content. Ako "
"je prazna, nijedna fascikla eksternih šablona neće biti korišćena za "
"pretragu šablona."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:361
msgid "Check for Denial-Of-Service Attacks"
msgstr "Proveri napade uskraćivanja usluge"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:361
msgid ""
"If it is true then then plugin will check if the number of files uploaded "
"within a specific amount of time exceeds the limit, thus protecting from DOS "
"attacks. It can be 'true' or 'false'."
msgstr ""
"Ako je true, dodatak će proveriti da li broj datoteka otpremljenih u okviru "
"određenog vremena prekoračuje ograničenje, čime se štiti od DOS napada. Može "
"biti 'true' ili 'false'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:362
msgid "Denial-Of-Service File Limit"
msgstr "Ograničenje datoteka uskraćivanja usluge"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:362
msgid ""
"Defines the maximum number of files that are allowed to be uploaded within a "
"specific amount of time. It can be any positive integer."
msgstr ""
"Definiše maksimalan broj datoteka koje je dozvoljeno otpremiti u okviru "
"određenog vremena. Može biti bilo koji pozitivan ceo broj."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:363
msgid "Denial-Of-Service Time Interval"
msgstr "Vremenski interval uskraćivanja usluge"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:363
msgid ""
"Defines the time interval for DOS attacks check. The time interval is given "
"in seconds."
msgstr ""
"Definiše vremenski interval za proveru DOS napada. Vremenski interval se "
"daje u sekundama."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:364
msgid "Denial-Of-Service Admin Email Frequency"
msgstr "Učestalost administratorskog imejla o uskraćivanju usluge"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:364
msgid ""
"Defines how frequently an email will be sent to administrator notifying for "
"Denial-Of-Service attacks. The time interval is given in seconds."
msgstr ""
"Definiše koliko često će imejl biti poslat administratoru sa obaveštenjem o "
"napadima uskraćivanja usluge. Vremenski interval se daje u sekundama."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:365
msgid "File Scan Buffer Size"
msgstr "Veličina bafera skeniranja datoteke"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:365
msgid ""
"Defines the buffer size when scanning file contents. A value of -1 denotes "
"that all file contents will be read at once."
msgstr ""
"Definiše veličinu bafera prilikom skeniranja sadržaja datoteka. Vrednost -1 "
"označava da će se sav sadržaj datoteke pročitati odjednom."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:366
msgid "File Scan Overlap Size"
msgstr "Veličina preklapanja skeniranja datoteke"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:366
msgid "Defines the overlap size when scanning file contents in chunks."
msgstr ""
"Definiše veličinu preklapanja prilikom skeniranja sadržaja datoteka u "
"segmentima."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:367
msgid "Filename Sanitization Mode"
msgstr "Režim sanitizacije naziva datoteke"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:367
msgid "The sanitization mode for filenames. It can be 'strict' or 'loose'."
msgstr "Režim sanitizacije za nazive datoteka. Može biti 'strict' ili 'loose'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:368
msgid "Sanitize Filename Dots"
msgstr "Sanitizuj tačke u nazivu datoteke"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:368
msgid ""
"Convert dot symbols (.) in filename into dashes, in order to avoid double "
"extensions. It can be 'true' or 'false'."
msgstr ""
"Pretvori simbole tačke (.) u nazivu datoteke u crtice, kako bi se izbegle "
"dvostruke ekstenzije. Može biti 'true' ili 'false'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:369
msgid "Wildcard Asterisk Mode"
msgstr "Režim džoker asteriska"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:369
msgid ""
"The mode of wildcard pattern asterisk symbol. If it is strict, then the "
"asterisk will not match dot (.) characters. It can be 'strict' or 'loose'."
msgstr ""
"Režim simbola asteriska džoker obrasca. Ako je strict, asterisk neće "
"odgovarati znakovima tačke (.). Može biti 'strict' ili 'loose'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:370
msgid "PHP Tag Checking File Types"
msgstr "Tipovi datoteka za proveru PHP oznaka"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:370
msgid ""
"The file types for which the plugin will check their contents for PHP tags. "
"It can be 'all', 'commonimages' or 'none'."
msgstr ""
"Tipovi datoteka za koje će dodatak proveriti njihov sadržaj za PHP oznake. "
"Može biti 'all', 'commonimages' ili 'none'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:371
msgid "MIME Type Validation Exceptions"
msgstr "Izuzeci validacije MIME tipa"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:371
msgid ""
"Exception rules when validating mime type of uploaded files. Check function "
"wfu_validate_mime_type() for details."
msgstr ""
"Pravila izuzetaka prilikom validacije mime tipa otpremljenih datoteka. "
"Proverite funkciju wfu_validate_mime_type() za detalje."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:372
msgid "File Scan Security Level"
msgstr "Nivo bezbednosti skeniranja datoteke"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:372
msgid ""
"Security level for file scanning. A zero (0) level means lowest security. "
"The default is one (1)."
msgstr ""
"Nivo bezbednosti za skeniranje datoteka. Nula (0) znači najniži nivo "
"bezbednosti. Podrazumevano je jedan (1)."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:373
msgid "Max PHP Array Length"
msgstr "Maks. dužina PHP niza"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:373
msgid "The maximum allowable number of items of a PHP array."
msgstr "Maksimalan dozvoljeni broj stavki PHP niza."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:374
msgid "Admin Browser Rows Per Page"
msgstr "Redova po stranici administratorskog pregledača"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:374
msgid ""
"The number of rows per page of the admin browser. A value equal to zero or "
"less denotes no pagination."
msgstr ""
"Broj redova po stranici administratorskog pregledača. Vrednost jednaka nuli "
"ili manja označava nema paginacije."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:375
msgid "History Log Table Rows Per Page"
msgstr "Redova po stranici tabele dnevnika istorije"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:375
msgid "The number of rows per page of the History Log table."
msgstr "Broj redova po stranici tabele Dnevnik istorije."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:376
msgid "Uploaded Files Table Rows Per Page"
msgstr "Redova po stranici tabele otpremljenih datoteka"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:376
msgid "The number of rows per page of the Uploaded Files table."
msgstr "Broj redova po stranici tabele Otpremljene datoteke."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:377
msgid "Use Alternative Randomizer"
msgstr "Koristi alternativni generator slučajnih vrednosti"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:377
msgid ""
"On fast web servers the plugin's generator of random strings may not work "
"properly causing various problems. If it is set to true, an alternative "
"randomizer method is employed that works for fast web servers. It can be "
"'true' or 'false'."
msgstr ""
"Na brzim veb serverima generator slučajnih stringova dodatka možda neće "
"raditi ispravno izazivajući razne probleme. Ako je postavljeno na true, "
"koristi se alternativni metod generatora slučajnih vrednosti koji radi za "
"brze veb servere. Može biti 'true' ili 'false'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:378
msgid "Force Email Notifications"
msgstr "Prinudno slanje email obaveštenja"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:378
msgid ""
"Send email notifications (if they are activated) even if no file has been "
"uploaded. It can be 'true' or 'false'."
msgstr ""
"Šalji obaveštenja putem imejla (ako su aktivirana) čak i ako nijedna "
"datoteka nije otpremljena. Može biti 'true' ili 'false'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:379
msgid "Update Media on Delete"
msgstr "Ažuriraj Mediju pri brisanju"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:379
msgid ""
"When an uploaded file is deleted then delete also the corresponding Media "
"Library item if exists. It can be 'true' or 'false'."
msgstr ""
"Kada se otpremljena datoteka obriše, obriši i odgovarajuću stavku Biblioteke "
"medija ako postoji. Može biti 'true' ili 'false'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:380
msgid "Dashboard Is Protected"
msgstr "Kontrolna tabla je zaštićena"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:380
msgid ""
"If /wp-admin folder is password protected then this variable should be set "
"to 'true' so that internal operations of the plugin can work. The username "
"and password should also be set."
msgstr ""
"Ako je fascikla /wp-admin zaštićena lozinkom, ova promenljiva treba da bude "
"postavljena na 'true' da bi interne operacije dodatka mogle da rade. "
"Korisničko ime i lozinka takođe treba da budu postavljeni."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:381
msgid "Protected Dashboard Username"
msgstr "Korisničko ime zaštićene Kontrolne table"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:381
msgid "Username entry for accessing protected /wp-admin folder."
msgstr "Unos korisničkog imena za pristup zaštićenoj fascikli /wp-admin."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:382
msgid "Protected Dashboard Password"
msgstr "Lozinka zaštićene Kontrolne table"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:382
msgid "Password entry for accessing protected /wp-admin folder."
msgstr "Unos lozinke za pristup zaštićenoj fascikli /wp-admin."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:383
msgid "Export Data Separator"
msgstr "Razdvajač podataka izvoza"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:383
msgid ""
"This is the delimiter of the exported file data columns. It can be any "
"symbol. Default value is comma (,)."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je razdvajač kolona izvezenih podataka datoteke. Može biti bilo koji "
"simbol. Podrazumevana vrednost je zarez (,)."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:384
msgid "Export User Data Separator"
msgstr "Razdvajač korisničkih podataka izvoza"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:384
msgid ""
"This is the delimiter of the exported user data of each file. It can be any "
"symbol. Default value is semicolon (;)."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je razdvajač izvezenih korisničkih podataka svake datoteke. Može biti "
"bilo koji simbol. Podrazumevana vrednost je tačka-zarez (;)."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:385
msgid "Disable Version Check"
msgstr "Onemogući proveru verzije"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:385
msgid ""
"If it is set to 'true' then the plugin will not check if there are any new "
"versions available. This is a temporary solution to problems having some "
"users accessing Iptanus Services server causing the plugin to stall. It can "
"be 'true' or 'false'."
msgstr ""
"Ako je postavljeno na 'true', dodatak neće proveravati da li su dostupne "
"nove verzije. Ovo je privremeno rešenje za probleme u kojima neki korisnici "
"pristupaju Iptanus Services serveru izazivajući zastoj dodatka. Može biti "
"'true' ili 'false'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:386
msgid "Relax cURL Host Verification"
msgstr "Opusti cURL verifikaciju hosta"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:386
msgid ""
"If it is set to 'true' then CURLOPT_SSL_VERIFYHOST will be disabled when "
"executing a cURL POST request. This is required in some cases so that the "
"plugin can reach https://services2.iptanus.com, because on some servers it "
"fails with a file_get_contents warning. It can be 'true' or 'false'."
msgstr ""
"Ako je postavljeno na 'true', CURLOPT_SSL_VERIFYHOST će biti onemogućen "
"prilikom izvršavanja cURL POST zahteva. Ovo je potrebno u nekim slučajevima "
"da bi dodatak mogao da dosegne https://services2.iptanus.com, jer na nekim "
"serverima ne uspeva sa file_get_contents upozorenjem. Može biti 'true' ili "
"'false'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:387
msgid ""
"If it is set to 'true' then the alternative Iptanus server will be used. "
"This is a work-around in some cases where the website cannot reach https://"
"services2.iptanus.com. It can be 'true' or 'false'."
msgstr ""
"Ako je postavljeno na 'true', koristiće se alternativni Iptanus server. Ovo "
"je rešenje u nekim slučajevima kada sajt ne može da dosegne https://"
"services2.iptanus.com. Može biti 'true' ili 'false'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:388
msgid "Alternative Iptanus Server"
msgstr "Alternativni Iptanus server"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:388
msgid "If it is set then this is the URL of the alternative Iptanus server."
msgstr "Ako je postavljeno, ovo je URL alternativnog Iptanus servera."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:389
msgid "Alternative Version Server"
msgstr "Alternativni server verzija"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:389
msgid ""
"If the alternative Iptanus server is used and this variable is not empty, "
"then it will be used as the alternative Version Server URL."
msgstr ""
"Ako se koristi alternativni Iptanus server i ova promenljiva nije prazna, "
"biće korišćena kao URL alternativnog servera verzija."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:390
msgid "Minify Inline CSS Code"
msgstr "Minifikuj inline CSS kod"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:390
msgid ""
"Defines whether the inline CSS code will be minified. It can be 'true' or "
"'false'."
msgstr ""
"Definiše da li će inline CSS kod biti minifikovan. Može biti 'true' ili "
"'false'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:391
msgid "Minify Inline JS Code"
msgstr "Minifikuj inline JS kod"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:391
msgid ""
"Defines whether the inline Javascript code will be minified. It can be "
"'true' or 'false'."
msgstr ""
"Definiše da li će inline Javascript kod biti minifikovan. Može biti 'true' "
"ili 'false'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:392
msgid "Session Legacy Option"
msgstr "Nasleđena opcija session"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:392
msgid ""
"Defines whether the old (legacy) operation of reading and storing session "
"data (using session_start in header) will be used. By default it is set to "
"'true' to maintain backward compatibility."
msgstr ""
"Definiše da li će se koristiti stara (nasleđena) operacija čitanja i čuvanja "
"session podataka (korišćenjem session_start u zaglavlju). Podrazumevano je "
"postavljeno na 'true' radi održavanja kompatibilnosti sa prethodnim "
"verzijama."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:393
msgid "Session Cookie Life"
msgstr "Trajanje session kolačića"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:393
msgid "Defines the life of session cookie, in hours."
msgstr "Definiše trajanje session kolačića, u satima."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:394
msgid "DB Option User State Base"
msgstr "Osnova User State DB opcije"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:394
msgid ""
"Defines how DB option defines the unique user state key. It can take the "
"values 'session' or 'cookies'."
msgstr ""
"Definiše kako DB opcija definiše jedinstveni ključ user state. Može uzeti "
"vrednosti 'session' ili 'cookies'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:395
msgid "DB Option User State Check Interval"
msgstr "Interval provere User State DB opcije"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:395
msgid ""
"Defines how often (in seconds) the plugin will update user state list, when "
"user state is saved in DB option table."
msgstr ""
"Definiše koliko često (u sekundama) će dodatak ažurirati listu user state, "
"kada je user state sačuvan u tabeli DB opcija."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:396
msgid "DB Option User State Life"
msgstr "Trajanje User State DB opcije"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:396
msgid ""
"Defines the maximum time of inactivity of a user state, when user state is "
"saved in DB option table."
msgstr ""
"Definiše maksimalno vreme neaktivnosti user state, kada je user state "
"sačuvan u tabeli DB opcija."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:397
msgid "User State Handler Changed"
msgstr "Rukovalac User State promenjen"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:397
msgid ""
"Defines whether the plugin changed automatically the user state handler "
"during installation."
msgstr ""
"Definiše da li je dodatak automatski promenio rukovaoca user state tokom "
"instalacije."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:398
msgid "Use Old DB Option Handler"
msgstr "Koristi stari rukovalac DB opcije"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:398
msgid "Defines whether the old DBOption user state handlers will be used."
msgstr "Definiše da li će se koristiti stari DBOption rukovaoci user state."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:399
msgid "Database Deadlock Timeout"
msgstr "Vremensko ograničenje zastoja baze podataka"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:399
msgid ""
"Defines for how long a deadlocked database transaction will be repeated."
msgstr ""
"Definiše koliko dugo će se transakcija baze podataka u zastoju (deadlock) "
"ponavljati."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:400
msgid "Log Database Errors"
msgstr "Beleži greške baze podataka"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:400
msgid "Defines whether database errors will be logged."
msgstr "Definiše da li će greške baze podataka biti zabeležene."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:401
msgid "Enable Queue Functionality"
msgstr "Omogući funkcionalnost reda"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:401
msgid "Defines whether queue operation is active."
msgstr "Definiše da li je operacija reda aktivna."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:402
msgid "Queue Thread Timeout"
msgstr "Vremensko ograničenje niti reda"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:402
msgid ""
"Defines for how long, in seconds, a queue will wait for a thread to finish "
"before aborting the operation."
msgstr ""
"Definiše koliko dugo, u sekundama, će red čekati da nit završi pre nego što "
"prekine operaciju."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:403
msgid "Queue Loop Delay"
msgstr "Kašnjenje petlje reda"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:403
msgid ""
"Defines the time, in milliseconds, a wait loop will sleep before continuing."
msgstr ""
"Definiše vreme, u milisekundama, koliko će petlja čekanja spavati pre "
"nastavka."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:404
msgid "Waste Options"
msgstr "Opcije otpada"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:404
msgid "Defines the plugin options that should be wasted after some time."
msgstr "Definiše opcije dodatka koje treba odbaciti nakon nekog vremena."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:405
msgid "Process Upload Waste Items After"
msgstr "Obradi stavke otpada otpremanja nakon"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:405
msgid ""
"Defines the time, in days, after which waste items related to uploads will "
"be discarded."
msgstr ""
"Definiše vreme, u danima, nakon kojeg će stavke otpada povezane sa "
"otpremanjima biti odbačene."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:406
msgid "Waste Items Batch Size"
msgstr "Veličina serije stavki otpada"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:406
msgid "Defines how many waste items will be stored for processing every time."
msgstr "Definiše koliko stavki otpada će biti sačuvano za obradu svaki put."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:407
msgid "Personal Data Visible Operation Levels"
msgstr "Vidljivi nivoi operacija ličnih podataka"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:407
msgid ""
"Defines how deep administrators can go into personal data operation details. "
"A value of -1 denotes that there is no limit."
msgstr ""
"Definiše koliko duboko administratori mogu da uđu u detalje operacija ličnih "
"podataka. Vrednost -1 označava da nema ograničenja."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:408
msgid "Personal Data Visible Permission Levels"
msgstr "Vidljivi nivoi dozvola ličnih podataka"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:408
msgid ""
"Defines how deep administrators can go into personal data permission "
"details. A value of -1 denotes that there is no limit."
msgstr ""
"Definiše koliko duboko administratori mogu da uđu u detalje dozvola ličnih "
"podataka. Vrednost -1 označava da nema ograničenja."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:409
msgid "Personal Data Visible Log Action Levels"
msgstr "Vidljivi nivoi radnji dnevnika ličnih podataka"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:409
msgid ""
"Defines how deep administrators can go into personal data log action "
"details. A value of -1 denotes that there is no limit."
msgstr ""
"Definiše koliko duboko administratori mogu da uđu u detalje radnji dnevnika "
"ličnih podataka. Vrednost -1 označava da nema ograničenja."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:410
msgid "Uploaded Files Menu State"
msgstr "Stanje menija otpremljenih datoteka"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:410
msgid ""
"Defines whether the Uploaded Files Dashboard menu item will be shown or not. "
"It can be 'true' or 'false'."
msgstr ""
"Definiše da li će stavka menija Otpremljene datoteke na Kontrolnoj tabli "
"biti prikazana ili ne. Može biti 'true' ili 'false'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:411
msgid "Uploaded Files Default Action"
msgstr "Podrazumevana radnja otpremljenih datoteka"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:411
msgid ""
"Defines the default action that will be executed when a file link is pressed "
"in Uploaded Files page. It can be 'details', 'adminbrowser', 'historylog', "
"'link', 'download' and 'none'."
msgstr ""
"Definiše podrazumevanu radnju koja će se izvršiti kada se pritisne link "
"datoteke na stranici Otpremljene datoteke. Može biti 'details', "
"'adminbrowser', 'historylog', 'link', 'download' i 'none'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:412
msgid "Uploaded Files Columns"
msgstr "Kolone otpremljenih datoteka"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:412
msgid ""
"Defines the visible columns of the Uploaded Files list as well as their "
"order. It is noted that 'File' column is always visible and it is the second "
"column if '#' column is visible, or the first one if '#' column is hidden."
msgstr ""
"Definiše vidljive kolone liste Otpremljene datoteke, kao i njihov redosled. "
"Napominje se da je kolona 'File' uvek vidljiva i predstavlja drugu kolonu "
"ako je kolona '#' vidljiva, ili prvu ako je kolona '#' sakrivena."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:413
msgid "Uploaded Files Actions"
msgstr "Akcije otpremljenih datoteka"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:413
msgid ""
"Defines the allowable actions and their order for each file in Uploaded "
"Files list. It is noted that the actions shown for each file depend on its "
"properties."
msgstr ""
"Definiše dozvoljene radnje i njihov redosled za svaku datoteku na listi "
"Otpremljene datoteke. Napominje se da radnje prikazane za svaku datoteku "
"zavise od njenih svojstava."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:414
msgid "Hide Invalid Uploaded Files"
msgstr "Sakrij nevažeće otpremljene datoteke"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:414
msgid ""
"Defines whether all uploaded file records will be shown in Uploaded File "
"menu or only the valid ones. Invalid are the records who are obsolete or "
"their files do not exist anymore."
msgstr ""
"Definiše da li će svi zapisi otpremljenih datoteka biti prikazani u meniju "
"Otpremljene datoteke ili samo važeći. Nevažeći su zapisi koji su zastareli "
"ili čije datoteke više ne postoje."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:415
msgid "Uploaded Files Reset Time"
msgstr "Vreme resetovanja otpremljenih datoteka"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:415
msgid ""
"Defines the interval in seconds before the unread uploaded files can be "
"marked as read. A value of -1 denotes that there is no interval."
msgstr ""
"Definiše interval u sekundama pre nego što nepročitane otpremljene datoteke "
"mogu biti označene kao pročitane. Vrednost -1 označava da nema intervala."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:416
msgid "Uploaded Files Toolbar Menu State"
msgstr "Stanje menija trake sa alatkama otpremljenih datoteka"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:416
msgid ""
"Defines whether the Uploaded Files Toolbar (Admin Bar) menu item will be "
"shown or not. It can be 'true' or 'false'."
msgstr ""
"Definiše da li će stavka menija trake sa alatkama Otpremljene datoteke "
"(Admin traka) biti prikazana ili ne. Može biti 'true' ili 'false'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:417
msgid "Uploaded Files Auto-Hide on Toolbar"
msgstr "Automatsko skrivanje otpremljenih datoteka na traci sa alatkama"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:417
msgid ""
"Defines whether the Uploaded Files Toolbar (Admin Bar) menu item will be "
"hidden when there are no new uploads. It can be 'true' or 'false'."
msgstr ""
"Definiše da li će stavka menija trake sa alatkama Otpremljene datoteke "
"(Admin traka) biti sakrivena kada nema novih otpremanja. Može biti 'true' "
"ili 'false'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:418
msgid "Show Shortcode Composer to Non-Admins"
msgstr "Prikaži kompozitor shortcode-a ne-administratorima"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:418
msgid ""
"Defines whether the shortcode composer will be visible to non-admin users "
"who can edit posts or pages. It can be 'true' or 'false'."
msgstr ""
"Definiše da li će kompozitor shortcode-a biti vidljiv ne-administratorskim "
"korisnicima koji mogu da uređuju objave ili stranice. Može biti 'true' ili "
"'false'."

