"opštijom WFU_FILEOPERATION_IGNOREREMOTE."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:452
msgid "Default Value of MD5 File for Remote Paths"
msgstr "Podrazumevana vrednost MD5 File za udaljene putanje"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:452
msgid ""
"Defines the default value that will be returned when md5_file() function is "
"executed on a remote (cloud) path. It can be '*empty', '*calc' or 'empty'. "
"If it starts with asterisk (*) then this variable takes precedence over the "
"more general WFU_FILEOPERATION_IGNOREREMOTE."
msgstr ""
"Definiše podrazumevanu vrednost koja će biti vraćena kada se funkcija "
"md5_file() izvrši na udaljenoj (u oblaku) putanji. Može biti '*empty', "
"'*calc' ili 'empty'. Ako počinje asteriskom (*), ova promenljiva ima "
"prednost nad opštijom WFU_FILEOPERATION_IGNOREREMOTE."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:453
msgid "Default Value of Unlink for Remote Paths"
msgstr "Podrazumevana vrednost Unlink za udaljene putanje"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:453
msgid ""
"Defines the default value that will be returned when unlink() function is "
"executed on a remote (cloud) path. It can be '*empty', '*calc' or 'empty'. "
"If it starts with asterisk (*) then this variable takes precedence over the "
"more general WFU_FILEOPERATION_IGNOREREMOTE."
msgstr ""
"Definiše podrazumevanu vrednost koja će biti vraćena kada se funkcija "
"unlink() izvrši na udaljenoj (u oblaku) putanji. Može biti '*empty', '*calc' "
"ili 'empty'. Ako počinje asteriskom (*), ova promenljiva ima prednost nad "
"opštijom WFU_FILEOPERATION_IGNOREREMOTE."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:454
msgid "Admin Notifications Rows Per Page"
msgstr "Redova po stranici administratorskih obaveštenja"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:454
msgid ""
"The number of rows per page of the admin notifications. A value equal to "
"zero or less denotes no pagination."
msgstr ""
"Broj redova po stranici administratorskih obaveštenja. Vrednost jednaka nuli "
"ili manja označava nema paginacije."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:455
msgid "Notifications Toolbar Menu State"
msgstr "Stanje menija trake sa alatkama obaveštenja"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:455
msgid ""
"Defines whether the Notifications Toolbar (Admin Bar) menu item will be "
"shown or not. It can be 'true' or 'false'."
msgstr ""
"Definiše da li će stavka menija trake sa alatkama Obaveštenja (Admin traka) "
"biti prikazana ili ne. Može biti 'true' ili 'false'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:456
msgid "Notifications Non-Repeating Threshold"
msgstr "Prag neponavljajućih obaveštenja"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:456
msgid ""
"Defines the time in seconds, after which a non-repeating notification can be "
"added again."
msgstr ""
"Definiše vreme u sekundama, nakon kojeg se neponavljajuće obaveštenje može "
"ponovo dodati."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:457
msgid "Material UI HTML Font Size"
msgstr "Veličina HTML fonta Material UI"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:457
msgid ""
"Defines the HTML font size, based on which the Material UI components' rem "
"value is calculated. It can be 'adjust' (React will try to adjust the HTML "
"font size so that it is always 16px), 'initial' (React will do no change) or "
"a font size in pixels."
msgstr ""
"Definiše veličinu HTML fonta, na osnovu koje se izračunava rem vrednost "
"Material UI komponenti. Može biti 'adjust' (React će pokušati da prilagodi "
"veličinu HTML fonta tako da uvek bude 16px), 'initial' (React neće izvršiti "
"nikakvu promenu) ili veličina fonta u pikselima."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:458
msgid "Webcam Switch Camera Mode"
msgstr "Režim promene kamere veb kamere"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:458
msgid ""
"Defines the switch camera mode. It can be 'side' (switch between front and "
"rear camera) or 'device' (switch between available video devices)."
msgstr ""
"Definiše režim promene kamere. Može biti 'side' (prebacivanje između prednje "
"i zadnje kamere) ili 'device' (prebacivanje između dostupnih video uređaja)."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:459
msgid "Webcam MediaRecorder MIME Type"
msgstr "MIME tip MediaRecorder veb kamere"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:459
msgid ""
"Defines the webcam MediaRecorder MIME Type. If it is empty then it will be "
"auto-selected."
msgstr ""
"Definiše MIME tip MediaRecorder veb kamere. Ako je prazno, biće automatski "
"izabran."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:460
msgid "File Reservation Status"
msgstr "Status rezervacije datoteke"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:460
msgid ""
"Defines whether file reservation is active. It can be 'true' or 'false'."
msgstr ""
"Definiše da li je rezervacija datoteke aktivna. Može biti 'true' ili 'false'."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:461
msgid "File Reservation Life"
msgstr "Trajanje rezervacije datoteke"

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:461
msgid ""
"Defines the life (in seconds) of a file reservation. It can be a positive "
"integer."
msgstr ""
"Definiše trajanje (u sekundama) rezervacije datoteke. Može biti pozitivan "
"ceo broj."

#: lib/wfu_constants.php:465
